{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>GENOME BREACH</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>A rogue-lite experience in Chimera CUSTOM XG</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">THE BREACH IS OPENING! You're the latest test subject in our high-stakes experiment to create the ultimate super soldier. Lucky You!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Drop in to procedurally generated combat sims packed with alien freaks, killer drones, and whatever else we cooked up in the lab. Blast through the chaos, stack up buffs and push your genome to the limit.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">With every challenge you overcome, Randi will offer rewards to tweak your loadout and juice your build. Start your runs as a blank C.U.S.T.O.M. clone. Find loot, grab it, and use it. That simple. No inventory, no item management, just pure destruction!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2229900/extras/975671120e96594f3ea47cc4d856c363.avif?t=1751645467\" data-has-big /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Chimera CUSTOM XG</strong> is a retro side-scrolling, action packed, bullet hell adventure. Fight the forces of evil in massive sandbox levels that evoke classic run-and-gun combat with challenging boss battles, weapon customization, and more!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2229900/extras/SteamSmall_2.gif?t=1751645467\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Cryo Upgrade Synthesis Tactical Operations and Mutations</strong> - The highly debated and controversial \u2018CUSTOM\u2019 weapons project is ready to use any classified XG technology to accomplish their mission.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2229900/extras/SteamSmall_5.gif?t=1751645467\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Find and upgrade your gear</strong> with unique abilities and mods!  Alter your biology with a stronger skeleton, fire proof skin, extra lungs and 14 toes!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2229900/extras/SteamSmall_3.gif?t=1751645467\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Become the ultimate force of nature</strong> by mutating your genetic code with the legendary abilities of Earth\u2019s most savage beasts!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2229900/extras/SteamSmall_1.gif?t=1751645467\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Team up, gear up, and take your powers to the extreme</strong> as you leave a wake of destruction across Earth\u2019s most ancient sites!  Be careful though, because the most dangerous thing you may find is\u2026the truth!</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2229900?t=1751645467","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2229900/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1751645467","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2229900/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1751645467","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2229900/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1751645467","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"Co-op","id":9},{"description":"Online Co-op","id":38},{"description":"Partial Controller Support","id":18},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":